  "question": {
    "text": "The number of real values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;that satisfies the equation&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>3</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8243;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />i.e. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>''</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math><br />Also, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/6a4966b6-d755-4814-b316-0403465e3d23.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.06667in;height:1.76042in\" /><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has <math><mn>2</mn></math> real roots",
    "image": null
  },
